# ---- merge-conductor append-union allowlist (optional, BH-4641) ----
# Files the conductor's rebase lane may resolve itself when main and the PR
# branch both only APPENDED a block at the same place: both blocks are kept,
# main's first, and the file must pass its validator (python sqlite3, jq plus a
# duplicate-key parse, node --check). Anything else stays conflict-unresolvable.
# Comma/space separated globs; `off` turns the step off. The settings row
# lane.merge-conductor.mc_union_files wins over this; unset = the default below.
#MC_UNION_FILES="worker/jobs/schema.sql worker/jobs/src/index.js catalog/llm-sites.json catalog/context-budgets.json worker/jobs/test/route-table.d/*"
